# Bandit Level 12 → Level 13

## Level Goal
The password is stored in `data.txt` and contains **compressed data** (likely `gzip`).

## Given Information
Username: bandit12  
Host: bandit.labs.overthewire.org  
Port: 2220  

## Approach
We need to decompress the file to get the password.

## Commands Used
ssh bandit12@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220  
file data.txt  
mv data.txt data.txt.gz  
gunzip data.txt.gz  
cat data.txt

## Explanation
`file` checks the file type.  
`gunzip` decompresses gzip files.  
The resulting file contains the password.

